version: 1.2.0
date-released: "2026-08-01"
keywords:
  - electrochemical impedance spectroscopy
  - distribution of relaxation times
  - equivalent circuit fitting
  - mixed ionic-electronic conductor
  - solid electrolyte
abstract: >-
  A six-stage Python pipeline for electrochemical impedance spectroscopy of
  high-resistance ceramic electrolytes and mixed conductors: Lin-KK validation,
  Tikhonov DRT deconvolution, Zarc equivalent-circuit fitting, and a global
  MIEC conductivity model, with reproducible, tested outputs.
